120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The idea is to create an IoT-enabled quadruped robotic surveillance system that can safely operate in hazardous and confined environments where human access and wheeled robots are ineffective. By leveraging quadruped mobility, advanced environmental sensors, and secure real-time data streaming, the robot autonomously navigates rough terrain while capturing visual, thermal, and positional data. All mission data is stored securely and made accessible through a web-based dashboard, enabling remote research teams to monitor, analyze, and respond to critical situations without physical exposure to danger.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
